# Cache migrations

Procedure: @.claude/skills/add-migration-step/SKILL.md

- A migration step reshapes records already cached in an existing object store. Adding or
  removing an object store or index is a `DB_VERSION` bump in `src/utils/idbCache.ts` instead; disposable data may just need a cache
  clear. Decide which before writing code.
- Steps must be idempotent and follow the skill's version-chaining and filename rules.
